---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="events">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Events</span><h1>Event schedule and interest form.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Confirmed listings include the date, room, organizer, access details, and registration link.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="#event-interest">Share event interest</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="#calendar">Check the schedule</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/circuit-boards-green.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Green printed circuit boards"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Check the schedule below</strong><p>The event-interest form asks what students would attend and when.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="calendar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Calendar</span><h2>Event schedule.</h2></div><p>Each published listing includes its current date, room, and registration status.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" id="event-grid" data-event-grid aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading planned events…</h3><p>Fetching the latest event information.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft" id="news">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Updates</span><h2>Society updates.</h2></div><p>Completed actions and confirmed announcements appear here.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid" data-news-grid aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading updates…</h3><p>Fetching published updates.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="event-interest">
  <div class="container split">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Event interest</span><h2>What would you attend?</h2><p>Share the event formats and meeting times that interest you. This form does not register you for an event.</p></div>
    <form class="form-shell" data-o32-form data-form-type="event_interest">
      <h3>Event interest</h3>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label class="form-field"><span>Your name</span><input type="text" name="full_name" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" required></label>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Email</span><input type="email" name="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required></label>
        <fieldset class="fieldset"><legend>Events you would attend</legend><div class="choice-grid"><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="events" value="community meeting"><span><strong>Community meeting</strong><small>Meet members and discuss priorities</small></span></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="events" value="3-2 discussion"><span><strong>3-2 discussion</strong><small>Questions about planning and partner programs</small></span></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="events" value="project session"><span><strong>Project session</strong><small>Prototype, test, document, or review work</small></span></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="events" value="guest speaker"><span><strong>Guest speaker</strong><small>Alumni, engineers, faculty, or researchers</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Best days</span><input type="text" name="best_days" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Example: Tuesday or Thursday…"></label>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Best times</span><input type="text" name="best_times" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Example: after 7 p.m.…"></label>
        <label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Company<input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <div class="form-actions"><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Send preferences</button><p class="form-status" data-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
